# Cloudflare Pages response headers (see SETUP.md, "Put the app online").
# Keep the site out of search engines and out of other sites' frames, and
# don't leak the page address to links people tap. Cloudflare already tells
# browsers to check for new versions of every file on each visit.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
